{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.299999237060547,"text":"A long table full of running water, with dams, wheels, pipes, and boats you can move around. You put on a waterproof apron and get wet anyway. What you learn cannot really be said in words. That water always goes down, that squeezing it makes it run faster, and that a dam does not stop water, but changes where it goes. You understand it with your hands, not with your head.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"long","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.9800000190734863},{"word":"table","start":0.9800000190734863,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"full","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"of","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":2.140000104904175},{"word":"running","start":2.140000104904175,"end":2.1600000858306885},{"word":"water","start":2.1600000858306885,"end":2.5199999809265137},{"word":"with","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"dams","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"wheels","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"pipes","start":5.019999980926514,"end":5.019999980926514},{"word":"and","start":5.21999979019165,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"boats","start":5.599999904632568,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"you","start":5.599999904632568,"end":5.860000133514404},{"word":"can","start":5.860000133514404,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"move","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"around","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"You","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.300000190734863},{"word":"put","start":7.300000190734863,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"on","start":7.460000038146973,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"a","start":7.71999979019165,"end":7.980000019073486},{"word":"waterproof","start":7.980000019073486,"end":8.380000114440918},{"word":"apron","start":8.380000114440918,"end":8.760000228881836},{"word":"and","start"